  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I think it would be useful to have a script for your avatar that you can put on a GameObject in it's hierarchy to mark the object as Friends Only. \n\nThe script could simply check if the user is a friend when loading the avatar locally and simply kill the GameObject if they aren't.\n\nAdditionally it would be nice to have a checkmark that reverses this behaviour as well, so GameObjects could be removed for friends and only shown for strangers. This could be useful for custom nameplates and the like showing off contact info such as discord and the likes, as well as well as give users more control over what they want to show to strangers and to friends.",
